  - Private routes/talks stay yours on exit + anonymous ice warning  <-> LAW_2 (Local Ring A + anonymous 2D warning)
  - Personal seat/quietness separate from unshakeable brakes/chassis <-> LAW_3 (Outer Shell 3 comfort vs. immutable Core 0)
  - Never inventing roads in thick fog, slowing down at roadworks    <-> LAW_4 (Independent 0/1 ground vs. open uncertainty)
  - High-speed calm without a flood of 10,000 warning pop-ups        <-> LAW_5 (Pre-Door-5 triage without -T throttling)
  - Every car-journey question is determined (`1`) by `[0..1]`; only `[2]` remains intentionally `OPEN`.
  - Cross-platform Tier-0 safety kernel (`AI0S-CORE.0s` + SHA-256 `core_integrity.py`), Day-0 bootstrap
    (`INITIAL-BOOT.0s`), 5 core lifecycle skills, cookbook, local-safety & `age`-encrypted vault code + 42 unit
